<title>USA: MBIA qualifies seven issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies seven issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said it has qualified for bond insurance the following seven municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Chandler, Ariz., $7.750 million refunding revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Ventura USD, Calif., $10 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Fremont, Calif., $8.3 million certificates of Participation.</p>
<p>--Acushnet, Mass., $7.325 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Worcester, Mass., $36.17 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Westhampton UFSD, N.Y., $5.913 million school district bonds.</p>
<p>--First Colony MUD#9, Texas, $4.950 million waterworks and sewer system revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
